    <string name="label_title_frame">LETS SELFIE &amp; WIN THE PRIZE!</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_kuis_selfie_1_1">JOIN TO OUR QUIZ AT</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_kuis_selfie_1_2">LETS WIN A PRIZE FROM TEBAK GAMBAR! SALAM IMAJINASI!!!</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_permainan_1">IN THIS GAME THERE ARE SOME LEVELS, EVERY LEVEL CONTAINS 20 QUESTION.</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_permainan_2">PLAYERS WILL BE HELD 5 ENERGY. AND EVERY WRONG WILL BE DECREASE 1 ENERGY.</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_permainan_3">THE QUESTION IN EVERY LEVEL IS THE KING QUESTION. YOU HAVE TO SOLVE THE PROBLEM TO GO TO THE NEXT LEVEL!</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_aturan_permainan_4">HAVE A NICE PLAY !!!</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_1">FIRST, YOU MUST IDENTIFY THE PICTURE.</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_2">NEXT. PAY CLOSE ATTENTION TO NEARBY LETTERS OR SYLLABLES. THEN MATCH THE WORD WITH THE CORRESPONDING PICTURE</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_3">IF THERE IS A CHANGE OF LETTERS OR SYLLABLES YOU HAVE TO CHANGE IT, SO IT BECOMES A NEW WORD.</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_4">AFTER ALL THE WORDS ARE FORMED. THEN THAT IS THE ANSWER!</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_5">EXAMPLE :</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_6">EXPLANATION :</string>
    <string name="label_tutorial_cara_menebak_gambar_7">THE ANSWER IS IMAJINASI. BECAUSE THERE IS IMA, JINN, AND RICE (NASI).\nEASY ISNT IT !</string>
